This project is a rewrite of the installer and runtime around the archived
pc2drc / libdrc / drc-hostap stack.

- pc2drc-ng scripts: GPL-2.0-or-later
- Upstream pc2drc (thefloppydriver): GPL-2.0
- libdrc (Mema Hacking): BSD-style, see the cloned sources
- OpenSSL 1.0.2u and libnl-1.1.4 are downloaded at install time into ./prefix
  and keep their own licenses

The full GPL-2.0 text is available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt
